WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.784
Coach Tim: I see that the Red Team has been working hard.

2
00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.747
Coach Tim: Good luck in the game.

3
00:00:20.748 --> 00:00:25.018
Coach Ryan: Good luck to the Blue Team too.

4
00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:27.610
Referee: Let's get started!

5
00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:32.981
Riley: The game is about to begin!

6
00:00:32.982 --> 00:00:35.487
Sarah and Ben: Go, Red Team!

7
00:00:35.488 --> 00:00:39.888
Chatter: Go, Blue!

8
00:00:39.889 --> 00:00:43.790
Blue Player: Ha-ha. That parrot is funny.

9
00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:46.355
Theo: He is not funny.

10
00:00:46.356 --> 00:00:49.978
Chatter is cheering for the other team.

11
00:00:49.979 --> 00:00:54.257
Riley: Skyler, you have to stop him!

12
00:00:54.258 --> 00:00:57.371
Skyler: I don't know how!

13
00:00:57.372 --> 00:00:59.981
Chatter: Go, Blue!

14
00:00:59.982 --> 00:01:04.493
Riley: The Blue Team has the ball!

15
00:01:04.494 --> 00:01:13.746
Theo: Skyler, get the ball!

16
00:01:13.747 --> 00:01:17.217
Crowd: Go, Blue Team!

17
00:01:17.218 --> 00:01:21.737
Chatter: Hooray! Go, Blue Team!

18
00:01:21.738 --> 00:01:25.280
Skyler: Chatter! You're supposed to cheer for us!

19
00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:28.593
Chatter: Go, Blue!

20
00:01:28.594 --> 00:01:32.364
Skyler: No, Chatter. Bad boy!

21
00:01:32.365 --> 00:01:40.596
Theo: Skyler, you missed the ball!

22
00:01:40.597 --> 00:01:45.037
Chatter: Blue, blue, blue!

23
00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:48.823
Jason: Skyler's parrot is cheering for the other team.

24
00:01:48.824 --> 00:01:52.749
Alexia: He made Skyler miss the ball.

25
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.129
Skyler: I wish I could make him stop!

26
00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:01.942
Chatter: Go, Blue!

27
00:02:01.943 --> 00:02:04.800
Referee: Halftime!

28
00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:07.121
Skyler: Chatter, I'm mad at you!

29
00:02:07.122 --> 00:02:09.964
You're cheering for the wrong team.

30
00:02:09.965 --> 00:02:14.547
Ben: Yeah. You're the Red Team's mascot!

31
00:02:14.548 --> 00:02:18.137
Theo: And the Blue Team scored two goals already.

32
00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:21.966
Jason: With Chatter cheering for them!

33
00:02:21.967 --> 00:02:28.209
Riley: He just likes their blue uniforms.

34
00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:31.080
Referee: Everyone, get back in the game!

35
00:02:31.081 --> 00:02:35.449
Skyler: This time Chatter better cheer for our team. Or else.

36
00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.616
Riley: Or else what?

37
00:02:37.617 --> 00:02:43.147
Skyler: Or else we'll lose!
